WEBVTT

00:00:28.329 --> 00:00:30.568
And we're doing this
through some case studies.

00:00:30.592 --> 00:00:32.057
A large chunk of our work

00:00:32.081 --> 00:00:33.597
has been put into transforming

00:00:33.621 --> 00:00:36.393
this neglected industrial ruin

00:00:36.417 --> 00:00:39.466
into a viable post-industrial space

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:40.967
that looks forward and backward

00:00:40.991 --> 00:00:42.228
at the same time.

00:00:42.252 --> 00:00:44.730
And another huge chunk of our work

00:00:44.754 --> 00:00:46.768
has gone into making relevant

00:00:46.792 --> 00:00:49.464
a site that's grown
out of sync with its time.

00:00:49.488 --> 00:00:52.508
We've been working
on democratizing Lincoln Center

00:00:52.532 --> 00:00:56.226
for a public that doesn't
usually have $300

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:59.991
to spend on an opera ticket.